结论：**FAIL**。当前字节为 `card/w9-lint@947ef206…`；只读审查，未修改工作区。裁定为 **0 BLOCKER + 3 HIGH + 4 MEDIUM + 2 LOW**。

## BLOCKER

无。

## HIGH

1. **round-7 H1 实际仍在：AUTO 先切段再逐段解析，丢失跨段 fence 状态。**

   位置：[vault_lint.py:340](/Users/Heishing/Desktop/canvas/canvas-learning-system/.claude/worktrees/card-w9-lint/backend/scripts/vault_lint.py:340)、[vault_lint.py:403](/Users/Heishing/Desktop/canvas/canvas-learning-system/.claude/worktrees/card-w9-lint/backend/scripts/vault_lint.py:403)

   反例：

   ```md
   <!-- AUTO-GENERATED by .claude/scripts/sync_board_concepts.py · source
        note -->
   ~~~text
   <!-- /AUTO-GENERATED -->
   [[A]]
   ~~~
   ```

   实跑：

   ```text
   segments=[
     (AUTO头+fence opener+END, True),
     ('[[A]]\n~~~\n', False)
   ]
   targets=['a']
   whole_tokens=[
     ('html_block', AUTO头),
     ('fence', '<!-- /AUTO-GENERATED -->\n[[A]]\n')
   ]
   ```

   整文 MarkdownIt 明确把 A 放在 fence 内，应报告孤儿；实现把 fence opener 随 AUTO 段丢掉，剩余段重新 parse 后制造入链。生产 `main()` 临时 fixture：

   ```text
   r7_forward rc=0 status=ok findings=[] inbound=1
   baseline_no_link rc=2 status=warn orphans=['节点/A.md']
   ```

   [UAT:178](/Users/Heishing/Desktop/canvas/canvas-learning-system/.claude/worktrees/card-w9-lint/_bmad-output/验收单/UAT-CARD-G8-2-统一lint骨架与三检查.md:178) 仍承认此交叉“不处理”，与本轮“r7 H1 已修复”声明直接冲突。M20 只验证完整 AUTO 段是否跳过，覆盖不到跨段 Markdown 状态。

2. **未闭合 AUTO 段在 EOF 被降级成普通正文，机器成员可隐藏真孤儿。**

   位置：[vault_lint.py:351](/Users/Heishing/Desktop/canvas/canvas-learning-system/.claude/worktrees/card-w9-lint/backend/scripts/vault_lint.py:351)、尤其 [vault_lint.py:368](/Users/Heishing/Desktop/canvas/canvas-learning-system/.claude/worktrees/card-w9-lint/backend/scripts/vault_lint.py:368)

   `in_auto=True` 到 EOF 时仍固定追加 `(buf, False)`：

   ```md
   <!-- AUTO-GENERATED by .claude/scripts/sync_board_concepts.py · source
        note -->
   - [[A]]
   ```

   输出：

   ```text
   segments=[(..., False)]
   targets=['a']
   unclosed_auto rc=0 status=ok findings=[] inbound=1
   ```

   对照完整 END：

   ```text
   segments=[(..., True)]
   targets=[]
   ```

   这是独立 false-green；现有 [AUTO 测试:356](/Users/Heishing/Desktop/canvas/canvas-learning-system/.claude/worktrees/card-w9-lint/backend/tests/unit/test_vault_lint.py:356) 及 M20 都只覆盖配平段。

3. **在 MarkdownIt 已解码的 `text.content` 上跑 raw wikilink 正则，会从源字节不存在的括号制造链接。**

   位置：[vault_lint.py:406](/Users/Heishing/Desktop/canvas/canvas-learning-system/.claude/worktrees/card-w9-lint/backend/scripts/vault_lint.py:406)；与其 [raw 同源声明:387](/Users/Heishing/Desktop/canvas/canvas-learning-system/.claude/worktrees/card-w9-lint/backend/scripts/vault_lint.py:387) 及 [_WIKILINK:133](/Users/Heishing/Desktop/canvas/canvas-learning-system/.claude/worktrees/card-w9-lint/backend/scripts/vault_lint.py:133) 冲突。

   实跑：

   ```text
   '\[\[A\]\]'             raw=[]  text-token='[[A]]'  targets=['a']
   '&#91;&#91;A&#93;&#93;' raw=[]  text-token='[[A]]'  targets=['a']
   ```

   生产入口：

   ```text
   escaped_brackets rc=0 status=ok findings=[] inbound=1
   html_entities    rc=0 status=ok findings=[] inbound=1
   ```

   无链接 baseline 是 `rc=2 / A孤儿`。反斜杠用于阻止 Markdown 语法生效是 Obsidian 的公开规则；社区也记录了转义方括号会清除 Graph 中的链接。[Obsidian 基础语法](https://obsidian.md/help/syntax)，[对应社区复现](https://forum.obsidian.md/t/toggle-ability-to-disable-links-with-backslash/38315)。

   此外，源码声称存在 `wikilink_basename/resolve_node_id` 同源锁，但：

   ```text
   rg -n 'wikilink_basename|resolve_node_id' backend/tests/unit/test_vault_lint.py
   # 无输出，rc=1
   ```

   M7 只能证明非 `text` token 不扫，不能发现 `text.content` 已被解析器改写。

## MEDIUM

1. **lazy import 正向行为通过，但直接依赖及环境错误退出码未闭合。**

   [vault_lint.py:89](/Users/Heishing/Desktop/canvas/canvas-learning-system/.claude/worktrees/card-w9-lint/backend/scripts/vault_lint.py:89) 直接导入 `markdown_it`；生产依赖真相源 [requirements.txt:12](/Users/Heishing/Desktop/canvas/canvas-learning-system/.claude/worktrees/card-w9-lint/backend/requirements.txt:12) 未直接声明它，[Dockerfile:15](/Users/Heishing/Desktop/canvas/canvas-learning-system/.claude/worktrees/card-w9-lint/backend/Dockerfile:15) 只安装该文件。当前 4.0.0 是 `fastapi-mcp → rich` 的传递依赖；项目又允许 Python 3.9，而锁文件对应 3.0.0。

   ```text
   markdown-it-py Version: 4.0.0
   Required-by: rich, ...
   uv.lock: Python <3.10 → 3.0.0
   ```

   缺包模拟：

   ```text
   PYTHONDONTWRITEBYTECODE=1 backend/.venv/bin/python -S \
     backend/scripts/vault_lint.py --vault <fixture> --only orphan_nodes --json

   rc=1
   ModuleNotFoundError: No module named 'markdown_it'
   ```

   [main:890](/Users/Heishing/Desktop/canvas/canvas-learning-system/.claude/worktrees/card-w9-lint/backend/scripts/vault_lint.py:890) 只捕获 `LintConfigError`，没有兑现 help 所声明的“环境错误 rc=3”。

2. **UAT 没有统一到 round-8 终态。**

   [UAT:48](/Users/Heishing/Desktop/canvas/canvas-learning-system/.claude/worktrees/card-w9-lint/_bmad-output/验收单/UAT-CARD-G8-2-统一lint骨架与三检查.md:48) 仍写三轮、未清零及 22 mutants；[UAT:90](/Users/Heishing/Desktop/canvas/canvas-learning-system/.claude/worktrees/card-w9-lint/_bmad-output/验收单/UAT-CARD-G8-2-统一lint骨架与三检查.md:90) 仍绑定 round-7、`aa2eca15…`、22 transcripts；[UAT:200](/Users/Heishing/Desktop/canvas/canvas-learning-system/.claude/worktrees/card-w9-lint/_bmad-output/验收单/UAT-CARD-G8-2-统一lint骨架与三检查.md:200) 的历史仍只到 r5，并保留“不合并”移交。当前实际为 `ffa51514… / 19 mutants / round-8`。UAT 本身不在 MANIFEST 绑定范围。

3. **live SHA 覆盖面声明仍宽于真实命令。**

   [live-sha-command.txt:1](/Users/Heishing/Desktop/canvas/canvas-learning-system/.claude/worktrees/card-w9-lint/_bmad-output/审查/evidence-g82/live-sha-command.txt:1) 使用：

   ```sh
   find ... -type f -not -name '今日复习.*' ...
   ```

   它会排除任意目录中同 basename 的文件，并跳过 symlink；但 [UAT:186](/Users/Heishing/Desktop/canvas/canvas-learning-system/.claude/worktrees/card-w9-lint/_bmad-output/验收单/UAT-CARD-G8-2-统一lint骨架与三检查.md:186) 宣称只排除 `outputs/今日复习.*`。第 51 行引用的“§6 第 11 条”也不存在。现存 before/after 相等只证明真实命令覆盖到的窄集合。

4. **MarkdownIt、Obsidian 渲染和项目图索引三者谁是 orphan 权威，仍未声明。**

   例如：

   ```text
   <span>[[A]]</span>
   children=[html_inline('<span>'), text('[[A]]'), html_inline('</span>')]
   lint targets=['a']
   ```

   Obsidian 明确声明 `<span>` 等 HTML 元素内不渲染 Markdown；项目生产图则由 [wikilink_graph_service.py:66](/Users/Heishing/Desktop/canvas/canvas-learning-system/.claude/worktrees/card-w9-lint/backend/app/services/wikilink_graph_service.py:66) 的 `obsidiantools.Vault.connect()` 建图。[Obsidian Flavored Markdown](https://obsidian.md/help/Editing%2Band%2Bformatting/Obsidian%2BFlavored%2BMarkdown)

   因图索引与渲染口径可能不同，本轮不将 HTML、`%%` 或数学块升级为 HIGH；但 UAT 必须明确 orphan 是按“可渲染链接”还是“生产图边”裁判。

